Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs18\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(118.4,16)}⌈Genius Kid Tsuntsun, datsun!⌉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Red, blue, red, blue, red... Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much I do, it never ends! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this job of {\i1}sorting ballpoint pens into red and blue{\i0} anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(183.2,29.867)\i1}Sorting ballpoint pens into red and blue: typically represents a system of categorization based on function, priority, or status.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I wanna quit! \NBut things are financially tight this month...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs12\pos(176.533,51.911)\i1}Blue Pens: Represent normal conditions, routine documentation, standard charts, and everyday patient notes \NRed Pens: Represent urgencies, emergencies, critical changes, or abnormal health conditions that require immediate attention.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, don't push yourself, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.65,0:00:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, thanks, Tsuntsun. \NDaddy will do his best!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.17,0:00:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, for hardworking Daddy, tsun-tsun-tsun-tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs28\1c&HFFB432&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(195.2,224)}For thinking faster
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Tsuntsun make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsun! If you drink this, your decision-making becomes 10 times faster than usual, tsun-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.23,0:00:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsuun! You can judge whether it's red or blue 10 times faster than before, tsun-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Red, blue, red, blue, red, blue! \NOh! I feel like my judgment for sorting red and blue is faster than before!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.78,0:00:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this sensation welling up from inside where seeing red means red and seeing blue means blue?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of faster decision-making, tsun-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's just helping out the power already inside Daddy to judge red as red and blue as blue, tsun-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.53,0:01:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you don't already have the power to judge red as red and blue as blue, it has no effect, tsun-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing! To think I have the power inside me to judge red as red and blue as blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, then for next week's share too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,if Daddy has that power!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mushroom, bamboo shoot, mushroom, bamboo shoot, mushroom, bamboo shoot, mushroom, bamboo shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.85,0:01:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Amazing, Tsuntsun! \NThis sensation welling up from inside! the feeling where seeing mushroom means mushroom and bamboo shoot means bamboo shoot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.81,0:01:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bacon, lettuce, tomato, bacon, lettuce, tomato, bacon, lettuce, tomato...
